{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0119tK91CTxpWjGRz5BusxiE","type":"tool_result","content":"63\t### ViLoMem\n64\t\n65\tViLoMem's transferable idea is dual-stream memory and retrieval. For code agents, generalize that to multiple typed memory streams:\n66\t\n67\t- code topology\n68\t- workflow episodes\n69\t- failure patterns\n70\t- semantic repo claims\n71\t- architecture decisions\n72\t- user/team preferences\n73\t- docs and contract state\n74\t\n75\tEach stream should have its own ranking rules, freshness semantics, and consolidation policy.\n76\t\n77\t### SRMA-Style Reflection\n78\t\n79\tUse SRMA-like concepts as quality metrics:\n80\t\n81\t- reflection quality\n82\t- consolidation quality\n83\t- retention quality\n84\t- drift detection\n85\t- retrieval alignment\n86\t\n87\tDo not build opaque autonomous self-rewriting memory. Reflection should be inspectable, testable, and reversible."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c80d671-1437-429b-9e3a-231a1f740b4b","uuid":"e79cca7e-999b-48a4-acee-034425e153d5","timestamp":"2026-05-17T07:18:56.274Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md","content":"### ViLoMem\n\nViLoMem's transferable idea is dual-stream memory and retrieval. For code agents, generalize that to multiple typed memory streams:\n\n- code topology\n- workflow episodes\n- failure patterns\n- semantic repo claims\n- architecture decisions\n- user/team preferences\n- docs and contract state\n\nEach stream should have its own ranking rules, freshness semantics, and consolidation policy.\n\n### SRMA-Style Reflection\n\nUse SRMA-like concepts as quality metrics:\n\n- reflection quality\n- consolidation quality\n- retention quality\n- drift detection\n- retrieval alignment\n\nDo not build opaque autonomous self-rewriting memory. Reflection should be inspectable, testable, and reversible.","numLines":25,"startLine":63,"total